WEBVTT

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.940
Couldn't it be me?

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.970
Matsushima...

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.890
You accepted my chocolates 
on Valentine's Day, right?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.110
I heard you didn't take anyone else's.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.120
That's because you came running, and—

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.290
I know. It'd be hard to 
decline in that situation.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.530
But you know...

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.040
It's really not fair to be nice like that.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.230
You'll just give me hope.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.780
I'm sorry. That wasn't fair of me, either.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:34.900
It's okay.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.090
I kept rambling, too.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.550
What an awful confession. I'm sorry.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.100
Why are you apologizing?

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:45.840
Then you're just denying your feelings.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.980
At least let me say thank you.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:55.500
Th-This is exactly what I 
mean about you being unfair.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.740
Wait, did I say something wrong again?

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.040
Oh, God, it's not on purpose. 
That's even worse.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.000
He's so unfair...

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.000
Huh? Wait, what?

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.590
<i>Do I have my apartment key?</i>

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.220
Thanks for hearing me out earlier.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:19.290
I basically just told you 
how I felt for my own sake.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.970
But I'm going to do my best 
to get you to like me back.

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:25.330
Count on that.

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.890
<i>Count on that, huh?</i>

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:42.650
<i>A year ago, I would've accepted 
Matsushima's confession then and there.</i>

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.140
<i>But right now...</i>

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.070
<i>What about Ichika-san?</i>

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:55.740
<i>If Ichika-san is suffering or sad 
because of our age difference...</i>

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.010
<i>I don't want that.</i>

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:00.960
<i>I really don't want that.</i>

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.290
<i>I'm so stupid. I can't 
believe I just did that.</i>

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:14.130
<i>I'm the one who asked him 
to tell me about her,</i>

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.410
<i>yet I got jealous and said all that.</i>

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.270
<i>But...</i>

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.240
<i>I got to tell him how I felt.</i>

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.250
That actually took a lot.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.750
It's gonna be super awkward seeing him 
at work, but I'll forget about that for now.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.040
Screw it! I'm taking a paid day off tomorrow!

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.230
It's foreign dramas and wine for me tonight!

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:39.760
I'm gonna drink until the sun comes up!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.760
<i>I haven't been here in a while.</i>

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:44.890
<i>Our age difference...</i>

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:49.190
I'm younger than you, 
and I'm not used to any of this...

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:53.310
<i>If I'm going to end up 
making Ichika-san sad...</i>

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.820
Ichika-san
M
Matsushima
Mom

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.570
Rio

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.570
Rio

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.570
Dad is 
coming home tomorrow.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:35.000
Koikimo

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Episode 10

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:40.000
"Being Prepared to Be Hurt"

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.510
Kisu Booksellers

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:53.730
<b>A boyish jacket
x Something black
Bring your charms to another level</b>

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:53.730
<b>Look cute yet mature
with a casual look</b>

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.820
Ichika, are you buying a book?

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.560
I'll be waiting for you by the entrance.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:56.130
Sure.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:04:59.480
Amakusa!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.360
Hey, Matsushima.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:06.420
This is yours. It got mixed 
up in marketing's stuff.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.380
Thanks for delivering it.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:12.040
Hey, no worries. I needed to come by anyway.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:15.040
By the way, you have a big 
meeting tomorrow, right?

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.290
Yeah, I'm getting ready for it right now.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.590
I see. Well, good luck.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.800
<b>Reflecting on Her Actions</b>

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.680
<i>Oh, God, I was so nervous...</i>

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.800
<i>Did I talk to him naturally?</i>

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.130
<i>I hadn't talked to him since that night,</i>

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.810
<i>so even trivial conversations 
make me so nervous.</i>

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:38.340
<i>Wait, was "good luck" the right thing to say?</i>

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.350
<i>What if that has the opposite effect?</i>

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:44.370
<i>Amakusa never shows how he's 
feeling, so I have no idea.</i>

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:47.700
Earth to Arrietty. We're at work. 
Come back down from your own planet.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.700
<i>Should I have said, 
"You've got this"? I have no idea...</i>

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.700
Thanks for inviting me over.

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:54.790
I bought some beer and random snacks.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.720
Thanks.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:02.960
It's rare for you to invite me 
over to your place for drinks.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.910
It doesn't hurt every once in a while.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.480
I'm also gonna watch some movies I've 
been meaning to watch, so stick around.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.470
Yeah, sure.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:13.430
But you've been back at your folks' 
place lately. Why are you back here?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.730
I'll be back over here for a while.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.650
Huh? Why?

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:25.330
My dad's back home.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.780
Ah. I see.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.970
Jeez. You seem really worried.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:32.660
Do you think I ran away?

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.580
Huh? Not really.

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:38.910
Jeez, what's the matter, Ryo-kun?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:42.670
You're a bit more prickly as of late. 
It's like we're back in high school.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.050
Sorry.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.880
I've just had a lot on my mind lately.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.470
About your dad?

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.540
There's that, but...

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:58.080
A coworker asked me out the other day.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:58.940
And?

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.100
I told her I had a crush on someone.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:08.150
But she said she was still going to 
work hard to get me to like her back.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:11.620
Oh, my goodness! 
What an admirable little girl!

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:14.680
She said she wanted to 
know more about my crush,

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:19.810
so I told her... that Ichika-san's 
my little sister's classmate.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:20.750
You told her that?!

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:24.560
She said we'd probably both be 
hurt because of the age difference,

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:27.340
so I'd be better off with her instead.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:29.900
I figure she's absolutely correct.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:35.850
I'm sure it'd be way more socially acceptable and realistic if I went out with her.

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:38.680
And it's likely better for Ichika-san, too.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:42.250
So I've been giving it a lot of thought...

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:45.360
Oh. I see.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.040
What kind of attitude is that?

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:47.910
What do you mean?

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.820
Don't give me that! Just tell me.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.490
Seriously, Ryo.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.600
You don't look okay with any of this.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:00.240
Listen, Ryo. You've been nothing 
but awful to all the girls who've

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.810
ever shown any interest in you.

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:04.750
<b>Stab</b>

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.750
Well, y-yeah...

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.200
And you're going to do something awful again?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.710
Be a decent guy for once.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:14.970
Going out with the girl who asked you 
out when you're feeling like that

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.720
is just insanely rude to 
both her and Ichika-chan.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:21.100
You're only thinking about yourself.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.850
You need to be prepared for the 
fact that you might get hurt.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.980
And that's all from me.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:31.740
All right. Let's watch some movies. 
What do you wanna watch?

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:35.610
You're right.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:38.990
I will. I'll be prepared.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.330
So, hey, is this coworker of yours cute?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.670
You know, you really are 
unfortunate sometimes.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.180
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:48.940
Do you really need me to 
explain "unfortunate"?

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.610
Whatever. So what are we gonna watch?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.830
<i>Three days ago, I got a call from Ryo-san.</i>

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:59.390
Ryo-san

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:01.890
<i>I'd like to take you to a 
sweets buffet for White Day.</i>

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.380
<i>Do you have any plans next Saturday?</i>

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:05.900
<i>And he invited me out.</i>

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:11.400
Was this one of the options 
from your presentation?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.400
<b>Ichika-san,
In regard to your White Day</b>

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:15.270
Yes! I thought one good deed deserves another,

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.420
so I decided to go with this plan.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.930
Oh, I see.

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:20.030
<i>So it was...</i>

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.750
Also, I figured it'd be better if 
we could enjoy something together.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:26.920
I-I see...

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.940
Do you not want to?

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:29.570
I—

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:34.550
I'm troubled because I don't mind it.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:39.300
<i>Why do I suddenly smell flowers?</i>

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.300
<i>I suddenly smell roses...</i>

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.480
<i>Come to think of it, we have gone out before,</i>

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.310
<i>albeit partially because he tricked me,</i>

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.430
<i>but this might be our first actual date.</i>

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.880
<i>No, this isn't a date!</i>

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>He's just doing this for White Day 
or something! Yeah!</i>

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.740
Wow... There are so many to choose from!

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.250
I don't know what I should get.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.510
I want to try one of everything.

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:10.300
Maybe I'll prioritize 
the strawberry sweets...

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:12.340
Ugh, what should I do?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.080
You're really struggling, huh?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.420
Can you blame me?!

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:20.330
Ryo-san! There's a chocolate fountain!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.450
Can I try it out?

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:22.680
Sure, of course.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:28.760
<i>I'm going to watch Ichika-san 
having fun dipping things</i>

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:30.120
<i>on an endless loop later.</i>

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.440
<i>She's just so cute.</i>

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.860
You'll get chocolate on your sleeve.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:40.330
Oh, sorry.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.530
I'm glad it didn't get dirty.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.740
You look very lovely in your outfit today.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.450
<i>Why did I actually buy this magazine?</i>

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.100
<b>Look cute yet mature
with a casual look</b>

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:54.660
Oh, th-this is just... We were going to 
a buffet, so I wanted to look nice.

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:56.680
Th-That's all it is!

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.400
It looks like they have 
dishes other than sweets.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.300
Yes, they have pasta, too.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.320
Ryo-san, is this your first 
time at a sweets buffet?

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.060
Yes.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:10.940
I see. I figured you'd been to 
one with another girl before.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:15.620
<i>Oh, no. That sounded awful...</i>

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.460
Ichika-san, could it be...

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.180
that you're jealous?

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:24.890
Just kidding.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.410
Huh?

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.860
Huh? Wait, you were actually jealous?

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:36.800
No!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:37.990
No, not at all!

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:43.050
<b>Eek</b>

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:43.050
<b>Eek</b>

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.140
I-I just figured you'd 
gone with someone before!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.050
That's why I asked!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:46.000
Don't get the wrong idea! Here's your plate!

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.560
Come on, Ryo-san! We have limited time!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.310
Oh, uh... Sure.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.680
Why are you beaming?

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.760
You're so creepy.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:03.820
<i>Why did I react like that earlier?</i>

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:08.030
The corners of my lips naturally form 
a smile whenever I'm with you, Ichika-san.

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:10.450
Maybe you should get that looked at.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:14.120
Yes. I have a severe case of being in love.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.450
Acting Section Chief?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.120
Oh, what?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.520
It is you.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:21.670
\hWork Mode: ON\h

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.080
Hey, what a coincidence.

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.670
It totally is.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.580
Do you like sweets, sir?

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.130
Yeah, I do.

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:28.720
Wow, that's sorta surprising.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:31.250
Is it? Just the three of you today?

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:32.180
Yes.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.150
It's actually my birthday today.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:37.370
So we're here to celebrate.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:40.620
I see. Well, happy birthday.

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:42.150
Thank you.

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:46.280
I'm probably too old to 
celebrate my birthday, but...

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.990
<b>Stare...</b>

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.990
That's not true.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:51.290
<b>And freeze</b>

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.290
Hey, I was wondering...

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:54.160
Is this your little sister, sir?

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.180
Huh?

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.940
Oh, you did mention that you 
had a sister in high school.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.500
You must be really close.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.510
No, she's not my—

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:02.510
Yes.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:07.500
You must work with my brother. 
Thanks for always looking after him.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.260
Oh, it's our pleasure.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.220
What year are you in?

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.230
I'll be starting my third in April.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.360
So that means you're still...

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.970
Yes, I'm seventeen.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:19.100
You're so young!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:25.980
Koikimo

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:30.990
Koikimo

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:30.990
I always end up
binging foreign dramas
for hours...

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:35.810
Sorry for interrupting your meal.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:37.250
If you'll excuse us.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.480
Oh, right.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.600
I'm starving.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:40.830
Oh, this? It's new.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:41.710
That looks good.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:42.890
Ichika-san.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:43.670
Um...

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:48.580
I'm sorry for lying. I'm glad 
they hadn't met Rio before.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.680
That's not...

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:55.770
I figured they might think it's weird that 
you're with your little sister's friend.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.770
So it just came out.

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.410
I'm sorry for lying.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:04.430
I'm not really worried about it. 
You were just looking out for me.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:05.660
But...

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:09.660
I wanted to introduce you as 
the person I'm in love with.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.650
B-But that would cause you a lot of trouble.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.810
Gloom...

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:21.790
Ugh, why are you so depressed?

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:30.260
Oh, this cake is really good!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.160
Here!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:35.880
We should have some fun since we're here!

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.150
Okay?

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.250
Yes.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.160
I'm so full.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:03.130
<i>As long as I'm by Ichika-san's side,</i>

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.400
<i>she might have to force herself to lie</i>

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:09.340
<i>and smile like that in secret.</i>

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.260
Ichika-san.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.250
Would you like to go look at the ocean?

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.580
Here's some tea.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.450
Thank you very much. It's so warm.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:33.420
Are you chilly at all?

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.280
I'm fine.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.830
I think this might be the first time I've 
come to the ocean at this time of year.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.910
The ocean during the spring is nice.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.960
Um... Was I able to properly repay you today?

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.900
What if I said no?

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:55.400
Then I'd be prolonging our 
activities further today.

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:58.650
Yes, you did.

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.310
I had fun, and the food was good.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:02.500
Really?

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.310
Now you're just fishing for compliments.

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:10.570
Yes, I really had fun. Thank you very much.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.930
I'm glad to hear it.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.830
Your personality is awful.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.710
<i>What society thinks and our age difference...</i>

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:28.840
Hey!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:29.590
Do we...

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.260
Do we still look like siblings?

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.120
<i>I wonder if she'll ever be able to...</i>

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:41.850
I-I don't think so...

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:51.740
<i>...love me enough to not 
care about any of that.</i>

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.840
That was a rather delayed scream.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:04.960
Wait, wait, what were you trying to do?

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.310
Exactly what it looked like.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.070
Don't get ahead of yourself! 
You idiot! You're the worst!

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.180
Right...

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.360
Be a decent guy for once.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:24.350
I am pretty awful.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.510
Haven't I been saying that this whole time?

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.840
I love that about you, Ichika-san.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.860
I got a really nice picture 
of the cake from earlier.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.220
Really?

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:39.450
I'll send you the picture.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.250
One sec. I'm going to edit it a bit.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:45.830
I'll turn up the contrast... then fix the hue...

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:46.830
Wow, you're really used to this.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.940
<i>Hey. Sorry to bother you on your day off.</i>

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:57.380
<i>Want to go drinking after work 
on Thursday? Just the two of us?</i>

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.060
<i>Since it's around White Day, 
I want to repay you,</i>

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.970
<i>and there's something I want 
to tell you, Matsushima.</i>

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:03.810
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.690
I just sent you the picture.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:07.940
<b>Ichika-san</b>

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:07.940
<b>Matsushima</b>

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:10.750
You're right. It's really pretty.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:14.250
A picture can change so much 
depending on who's taking it.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:16.340
It's called editing.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.190
But look at this brilliance.

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:20.550
Train is arriving

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.350
No.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:24.450
This is my treat to you for White Day.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.400
Wow, thank you.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.490
Oh, I've heard these shortbread 
cookies are great.

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:35.540
That's what the employee 
recommended, so I got them.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:36.840
I'm glad they're popular.

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:39.840
Maybe I'll have them as a 
treat for my hard work.

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:42.080
So...

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:46.540
You had something you 
wanted to tell me, right?

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.000
Can I get straight to the point?

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:54.570
I'd honestly prefer that.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.030
I see... You're right.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:02.730
<i>I can pretty much guess what 
Amakusa wants to tell me.</i>

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.560
<i>Especially if it's something important.</i>

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.540
All right. I'll just say it.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.440
I want you to give up on me.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:19.820
To be honest, I thought it'd be 
better if I went out with you...

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:23.860
Both for me and for my crush.

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:32.050
I know I'm just thinking about myself... 
And this is really rude toward you. I'm awful.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.620
But I just couldn't.

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:40.750
Even if our age difference might make 
us suffer, she's the only one for me.

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:44.730
I'm being pretty awful right now,

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.880
but you were sincere with your feelings for me,

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.700
so I wanted to be honest with you, as well.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.710
I'm sorry. That's why I 
want you to just give up.

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.020
Please.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:00.600
Huh?

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.090
What?! Wait, don't apologize like that!

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:13.100
All right. I'll give up.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.520
I said I would work hard 
to get you to like me,

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:17.610
but I'll give up.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.260
Matsushima...

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:24.110
You see... I actually didn't like 
you very much until just recently.

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:24.810
Huh?

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:26.980
You were really hard to approach.

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:27.860
Really?

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:28.700
Yeah.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:33.710
But you've seemed much 
more approachable lately.

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:37.710
And that's when I started to fall for you.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:41.710
You probably changed because of your crush.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:46.450
You always have such a kind look 
on your face when you talk about her.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:49.210
Oh... I didn't even notice.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:54.560
I think I like the part of you 
that's in love with your crush.

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:58.350
So I had lost from the start.

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:01.840
Lost? This isn't about winning or losing.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.190
It is, though.

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.610
You're going to deal with 
the age difference, right?

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:10.200
You need enough resolve to do everything 
you can to get her to notice you.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:12.700
So... do your best.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:15.580
All right.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.730
Sorry, that almost ended up being a lecture.

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.840
This looks really good. Let's eat.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.170
Oh, I'm gonna stop by a place on my way home.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.590
Can we part ways here?

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:29.100
Sure. Thanks for everything today.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:32.560
No, thank you. I'll see you tomorrow at work.

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:37.060
Yeah, see you.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:38.900
Be careful.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:39.610
Yeah.

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:02.780
Ah... It's good...

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:16.020
I did well today. I think 
I deserve these right now.

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:22.250
I need to call Ichika-san 
before it gets too late.

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:27.970
<i>You're going to deal with 
the age difference, right?</i>

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:32.000
<i>You need enough resolve to do everything 
you can to get her to notice you.</i>

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:39.320
<i>Sometimes, resolve just isn't enough.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
Next Time

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
"High Schooler"

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:38.230
Next time, "High Schooler."
